=== VERDICT-ALPHA BATTERY (goal #101 item 4, THE DERIVED-alpha CLOCK) seed=7 reps=6 2026-08-21T18:40:41Z
CONTRACT goal-gate "THE VERDICT-ALPHA BATTERY -- PRE-REGISTRATION", and nothing else. Paper 16.76 is the clock's derivation and 16.79.7 names the member.
CELLS c7   (c1/c7/sc2 are the THREE STABLE cells and carry the verdict; c8 is the LOSS-HEAVY WITNESS cell and carries none. c8L is not run at all: 52x rep dispersion.)
ARMS-MEANING CTL = the shipped machine, all three gates ABSENT, byte-identical (2*srtt).clamp(25,100) ms; Q400 = W_q(alpha*) at the MEASURED BOUNDARY OPTIMUM alpha* = 0.40, the MAXIMAL NON-NULL member of the derived-alpha family (paper 16.79.7)
ARMS  CTL Q400   (paired within rep, ARMS INNERMOST)
ARMENV CTL alpha=unset form=unset gates_form=cantelli win_n=unavail | env="RWM_QUANTILE_CLOCKS=0 RWM_DELTA_CAP=1 RWM_SUM_CAP=1 RWM_RACK_CLOCKS=0 RWM_DERIVED_SWEEP=0 RWM_COMPOSED_CAP=0 RWM_THREE_TERM=0 RWM_STORE_CAP_UNIFIED=0 RWM_LATE_BRAKE=0 RWM_CHARGE_RECOVERY=0 RWM_RELEASE_1TO1=0 RWM_LOSS_SENT_TRUTH=0 RWM_RTT_DUMP=0 RWM_SUCC_DUMP=0"
ARMENV Q400 alpha=0.4 form=quantile gates_form=quantile win_n=25 | env="RWM_QUANTILE_CLOCKS=1 RWM_ALPHA_OVERRIDE=0.4 RWM_W_FORM=quantile RWM_DELTA_CAP=1 RWM_SUM_CAP=1 RWM_RACK_CLOCKS=0 RWM_DERIVED_SWEEP=0 RWM_COMPOSED_CAP=0 RWM_THREE_TERM=0 RWM_STORE_CAP_UNIFIED=0 RWM_LATE_BRAKE=0 RWM_CHARGE_RECOVERY=0 RWM_RELEASE_1TO1=0 RWM_LOSS_SENT_TRUTH=0 RWM_RTT_DUMP=0 RWM_SUCC_DUMP=0"
AXIS  RWM_QUANTILE_CLOCKS + RWM_W_FORM + RWM_ALPHA_OVERRIDE, all ABSENT/OFF by default. GARBAGE and any alpha outside (0,1) resolve back to ABSENT and print unset.
ALPHA-LITERAL the [GATES] echo prints the RESOLVED f64 through Rust's own to_string(): 0.40 renders as 0.4 and the arm table matches THAT, literally
MIRRORED-AXIS RWM_HOLDDOWN_Q and RWM_REFRESH_FLOOR_US are the PREVIOUS battery's axes and are asserted ABSENT (unset), two-sided, on EVERY row of this one
GRID  c7 shipped_clock_us=100000 band=[140,180] paths=2 spec="c2 c2 dual   200000000"
F1    THE WIRING WITNESS, SCORED FIRST: the WCLOCK lines. The armed arm must read law_n > 0 and win_n = 25 two-sided; CTL must read its cell's SHIPPED clock. It is a RESULT line and NEVER an abort.
ARM-VOID (law_n=0 on the armed arm) is a RESULT and never an abort
WINDOW-PARTIAL (win_ok < evals) is a RESULT and never an abort -- the fraction is to be scored
DIM1  DELIVERED LATENCY, per-leg, censoring-aware: the WORST LEG's p50 AND p95 from the RWM_LATPROBE per-leg ping, with legs_censor_max beside every reading
DIM2  REALIZED FALSE REPAIR: [RFA] false_frac AND [RFA] false (the COUNT), both, plus the commanded [RACK] fa_frac -- and each compared against the DERIVED alpha 0.40 as well as against CTL
GUARD goodput. G1 = the CTL band, ABSOLUTE. G2 = Copa utility at delta_auto = 0.5. See the pre-registration.
BANDSCOPE the goodput abort bands apply to CTL ONLY (band_applies=1); an out-of-band TREATMENT reading is a RESULT -- it is the guard's G1 reading
